# CYD Phase 1c — Touch Input [SPEC:CYD-TOUCH]

> XPT2046 resistive touch on shared HSPI bus, calibrated to screen coordinates, dispatched to widgets via hit testing.

**This is BUILT and shipping.** The document was written as a work order; it has been
brought current to the code and should be read as a description, not as instructions.

