## 6. Compliance [CYD-TOUCH-COMPLIANCE]

| ID | Requirement | Verification |
|----|-------------|-------------|
| TC-C1 | XPT2046 reads valid raw coordinates when screen is touched | Serial log shows raw_x, raw_y, pressure values on touch |
| TC-C2 | Calibrated coordinates map to correct screen position | Touch corners of display, verify coordinates match ±5px |
| TC-C3 | Tap on gauge widget fires on_tap and changes displayed value | Visual: gauge needle moves to tapped position |
| TC-C4 | Tap on LED widget toggles state | Visual: LED color changes |
| TC-C5 | Tapping empty area (no widget) produces no effect | No crash, no spurious widget activation |
| TC-C6 | Touch reads do not corrupt display output | Display renders cleanly during continuous touch polling |
| TC-C7 | Debounce prevents double-tap from single press | Log shows single TAP event per finger press |
| TC-C8 | Spec 15 ED-C2 — dispatch touch tap to correct widget | Hit test selects topmost widget at touch coordinates |

